{"abstract":[{"text":"Why a volume was rebuilt, left alone, or reported — kept on disk.","type":"text"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/docs.GrrCloneCore\/documentation\/GrrCloneCore"]]},"metadata":{"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"HealthLog","kind":"identifier"}],"externalID":"s:12GrrCloneCore9HealthLogC","role":"symbol","symbolKind":"class","roleHeading":"Class","modules":[{"name":"GrrCloneCore"}],"title":"HealthLog","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"actor"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"HealthLog"}]},"relationshipsSections":[{"title":"Conforms To","identifiers":["doc:\/\/docs.GrrCloneCore\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/docs.GrrCloneCore\/ScA"],"type":"conformsTo","kind":"relationships"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/grrclonecore\/healthlog"]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"actor"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"HealthLog"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"type":"heading","anchor":"overview","text":"Overview","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The daemon’s log is in memory and holds rclone’s view; it says a new NFS server"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"started, never why. On 2026-09-25 CloudVaults was rebuilt while the server’s own"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"log showed every request answered in a tenth of a second, and nothing on the Mac"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"could say whether a timer, a wake or a click had done it (#154). This answers"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"that: one line per decision, with the trigger, each probe’s result and how long"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"it took, and the upload count that was weighed."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Only decisions. A healthy pass every five minutes is not written, or the file"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"would be all noise. Your own connects and disconnects are, because “did I click"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"something?” is the first question when a volume changed."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Nothing sensitive: the volume’s display name and mount point, never a remote’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"configuration, URL or credential.","type":"text"}]}],"kind":"content"}],"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","topicSections":[{"title":"Initializers","anchor":"Initializers","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/docs.GrrCloneCore\/documentation\/GrrCloneCore\/HealthLog\/init(fileURL:maxBytes:)"]},{"title":"Instance Properties","anchor":"Instance-Properties","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/docs.GrrCloneCore\/documentation\/GrrCloneCore\/HealthLog\/fileURL"]},{"title":"Instance Methods","anchor":"Instance-Methods","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/docs.GrrCloneCore\/documentation\/GrrCloneCore\/HealthLog\/recent(limit:)","doc:\/\/docs.GrrCloneCore\/documentation\/GrrCloneCore\/HealthLog\/record(_:volume:mountPoint:outcome:detail:at:)"]},{"title":"Type Methods","anchor":"Type-Methods","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/docs.GrrCloneCore\/documentation\/GrrCloneCore\/HealthLog\/defaultURL()","doc:\/\/docs.GrrCloneCore\/documentation\/GrrCloneCore\/HealthLog\/stampFormatter()"]},{"title":"Enumerations","anchor":"Enumerations","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/docs.GrrCloneCore\/documentation\/GrrCloneCore\/HealthLog\/Trigger"]},{"title":"Default Implementations","anchor":"Default-Implementations","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/docs.GrrCloneCore\/documentation\/GrrCloneCore\/HealthLog\/Actor-Implementations"]}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/docs.GrrCloneCore\/documentation\/GrrCloneCore\/HealthLog"},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"referenc